// Economic-zone polygons for assets/regions/continental_europe_maghreb.ron (Plan 7 Task 9).
// The offline example rasterises them into that file's economic_zones.cells:
//   cargo run -p infrastructure --example author_economic_zone_cells -- \
//       assets/regions/continental_europe_maghreb.ron \
//       crates/infrastructure/authoring/continental_europe_maghreb_economic_zones.ron
// Each zone is one Natural Earth v5.1.2 1:50m admin-0 country, extracted with the region's
// bounds, grid and 0.02 degree tolerance so its borders are the region file's borders:
//   python3 -I tools/region_authoring/natural_earth.py \
//       --admin0 target/natural-earth/ne_50m_admin_0_countries.geojson --include ISO:<A3> \
//       --bounds=-16.65,44.95,22.87,59.87 --grid 154,123 --tolerance-deg 0.02 --dissolve
// (ESP: unsimplified area outside the output 1.323%, the Canaries and other islets under the
// 2-cell floor, none of them playable; MAR: 0.194%). Each zone also takes the region file's
// nudge rings in that country, so a nudged coastal cell keeps its country's market.
// Every other playable cell (all other countries, and water) is the regional default, 0.
